Description: Python library used by U-Boot tools such as patman and buildman
 This library provides the common code used by U-Boot's Python tools,
 including patman, binman and buildman:
 .
  - running commands and pipelines and capturing their output
  - running tools and handling files and temporary directories
  - working with git repositories
  - coloured terminal output and logging
  - running test suites, in parallel where possible
 .
 Running Claude agents (u_boot_pylib.claude) needs the claude-agent-sdk,
 which is not packaged in Debian and so is not pulled in here.
